      "created_at": "2013-09-13T17:59:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When I got my copy of Shattered Timelines, I was annoyed to note that one of Chrono Ranger's cards has a marked back - large white chunks missing from the black border, and some damage to the ST logo.&nbsp; I went to the webstore and found a section listed \"Replacements\", hoping that I could pay a dollar or so and get a new copy of that one card; they could just stick it in an envelope and mail it to me, so I wouldn't have to pay the shipping cost for a whole box.&nbsp; However, while the links on the side show \"Replacements (7)\", clicking on that link doesn't actually reveal anything.&nbsp; Is this functionality currently disabled or something?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:14.796Z",
