      "raw": "<p>When I got my copy of Shattered Timelines, I was annoyed to note that one of Chrono Ranger&#39;s cards has a marked back - large white chunks missing from the black border, and some damage to the ST logo.&nbsp; I went to the webstore and found a section listed &quot;Replacements&quot;, hoping that I could pay a dollar or so and get a new copy of that one card; they could just stick it in an envelope and mail it to me, so I wouldn&#39;t have to pay the shipping cost for a whole box.&nbsp; However, while the links on the side show &quot;Replacements (7)&quot;, clicking on that link doesn&#39;t actually reveal anything.&nbsp; Is this functionality currently disabled or something?</p>",
